# ts-rs auto-export artifact.
#
# `#[ts(export)]` makes ts-rs emit a per-type test that writes the binding to
# `./bindings` (relative to this crate) on `cargo test`. That output is a
# throwaway side effect — the authoritative, reviewed contracts live in
# `contracts/generated/` (regenerated by the `export_contracts` binary and
# guarded by the `contract_drift` test). Keep the auto-export out of git.
/bindings/
